<li>انتقل إلى <a href="https://github.com/mohamedourchich/My-website-" target="_blank" rel="nofollow">GitHub</a></li>
<li>انقر على زر "Add file" ثم "Upload files"</li>
<li>اسحب وأفلت الملفات المهمة أو استخدم زر "choose your files" لاختيارها</li>
<li>اكتب رسالة commit مناسبة وقم بالتأكيد</li>
</ol>
<p>أي من هذه الخيارات تفضل للمضي قدمًا؟</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=" useView_view__C2mnv Events_userMessage__Ne1GX"><div data-cy="user-message" class=" useView_view__C2mnv useView_isHorizontal__Q1YOp" data-event-type="user-message" style="--useView--gap: 8px; --useView--justify: end; --useView--pt: 16px; --useView--pb: 16px; --useView--pl: 32px;"><div class=" useView_view__C2mnv css-1fiom15"><span class=" useView_view__C2mnv"><div class=" useView_view__C2mnv css-liy9s4 Surface_surfaceHigher__glqx6" data-acknowledged="true"><div class="rendered-markdown css-0"><div class="css-15jd14a"><p>طريقه التانيه</p></div></div></div></span><div class=" useView_view__C2mnv useView_isHorizontal__Q1YOp" style="--useView--gap: 4px; --useView--pr: 8px; --useView--pl: 8px;"><div class=" useView_view__C2mnv"><span class=" useView_view__C2mnv css-85lk56" data-chromatic="ignore" tabindex="0"><span class=" useView_view__C2mnv Text_text__T_hn_ Text_singleLine__lXpWA" style="--Text--font-family: inherit; --Text--font-size: var(--font-size-small); --Text--line-height: var(--line-height-small); --Text--color: var(--foreground-dimmest);">18 minutes ago</span></span></div></div></div><div class=" useView_view__C2mnv css-l5xv05" style="--useView--pt: 6px;"><div class=" useView_view__C2mnv css-79elbk"><div class=" useView_view__C2mnv css-e984aq" style="--size: 24px; --ring-size: 1px; --ring-color: var(--outline-dimmer); --has-on-click-shadow: inset 0 0 0 var(--ring-size) var(--ring-color); --border-radius: var(--border-radius-round);"><div class=" useView_view__C2mnv css-1nbdh03" aria-hidden="true"><div class=" useView_view__C2mnv css-q3z88u">OM</div></div><span style="box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; width: initial; height: initial; background: none; opacity: 1; border: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; position: relative; max-width: 100%;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; display: block; width: initial; height: initial; background: none; opaci